@startuml fig0_experiment_flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam arrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #2E86C1
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #D4AC0D
skinparam swimlaneBorderThickness 1
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam titleFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontStyle bold

title Simulation-Based Benchmark: Experiment Pipeline

|#EAF2FF| Data Preparation |
start
:Load **Fact Sheets**\n· 150 IS cases (known intents)\n· 50 OOS cases (9 novel intents)\n· JSON ground truth + expected tools;

fork
  :Polite\nPersona;
fork again
  :Adversarial\nPersona;
fork again
  :VIP\nPersona;
end fork

:Cross **4 Architectures** × **3 Personas**\n→ IS: 1,800 conversations\n→ OOS: 600 conversations;

|#E9F7EF| Simulation Loop |
repeat
  :**Customer Agent** (Gemini-2.0-flash-lite)\nGenerates turn message\nper Persona script;

  :Runner guards\n· Identity check (require Order ID / email)\n· DEDUP (block repeated tool calls)\n· Loop detection (exact-match on last 2 responses);

  :Service Agent (**llama3.1:8b**)\n[Single-slot / ReAct / Reflection / PlanExecute];

  if (Tool call\ndetected?) then (yes)
    :Execute simulated tool\n**query_order** · **cancel_order**\n**apply_refund** · **get_policy**;
    :Return observation to agent;
  else (no)
  endif

  :Check termination condition;

repeat while (Conversation continues?) is (yes)
->no;

:Record final status\n**SUCCESS** / **LOOP_FAILURE** / **FAILED_INCOMPLETE**;

|#FEF9E7| Evaluation |
fork
  :Rule-based Metrics\n· S_Tool (ToolF1 + ArgCorrectness)\n· S_Trajectory (flow, loops, identity)\n· S_Efficiency (token proxy)\n· I_fatal (safety gate);
fork again
  :LLM-as-Judge (**Gemini**)\n· Blind evaluation (no arch name)\n· CoT scoring\n· S_Resolution · S_Completeness · S_Tone\n→ S_AnswerQuality (0–100);
end fork

:Compute **S_Agent**\n= 0.50 · S_Outcome + 0.20 · S_Tool\n+ 0.10 · S_Traj + 0.20 · S_Eff\n(capped at 40 if I_fatal = 1);

:Compute **ProxyCost · NetValue · ΔMB**;

|#F5EEF8| Analysis |
fork
  :**PSS** (ProSA)\nCross-Persona sensitivity\nper architecture & intent;
fork again
  :**Weight Sensitivity**\n969 weight combinations\nRank-1 stability check;
fork again
  :**IS → OOS Gap**\nGeneralization drop\n& NetValue collapse;
end fork

stop

@enduml
